        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac38(3\\sqrt{10}+5\\sqrt2)$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{3\\sqrt5}{3\\sqrt2-\\sqrt{10}}&=\\frac{3\\sqrt5}{3\\sqrt2-\\sqrt{10}}\\times\\frac{3\\sqrt2+\\sqrt{10}}{3\\sqrt2+\\sqrt{10}}\\\\\\frac{3\\sqrt5}{3\\sqrt2-\\sqrt{10}}&=\\frac{9\\sqrt{10}+3\\sqrt{50}}{18-10}\\\\\\frac{3\\sqrt5}{3\\sqrt2-\\sqrt{10}}&=\\frac{9\\sqrt{10}+15\\sqrt2}{8}\\\\\\frac{3\\sqrt5}{3\\sqrt2-\\sqrt{10}}&=\\frac38(3\\sqrt{10}+5\\sqrt2)\\end{align*}$$",
